# .dockerignore — ML Incident Response API
# =========================================
# MED-B REMEDIATION: Prevents sensitive files, dev artifacts, and VCS
# history from entering the Docker build context and image layers.
#
# Critical entries:
#   .env / .env.*   — secrets must NEVER be baked into an image
#   .git            — VCS history is irrelevant and may contain secrets
#   tests/          — test code and fixtures have no runtime role
#   __pycache__     — bytecode from host Python must not bleed into image
#
# SEC-03 REMEDIATION:
#   api/stub_users.py — dev-only in-memory user store; excluded from image
#                       so the env guard cannot be the sole protection layer.

# ── Secrets and environment files ──────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# ── Dev-only source files (SEC-03) ──────────────────────────────────
api/stub_users.py

# ── Version control ───────────────────────────────────────────────
.git
.gitignore
.github

# ── Python bytecode and caches ────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__
**/__pycache__
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd
.pytest_cache
.mypy_cache
.ruff_cache
**/.coverage
coverage.xml

# ── Test artifacts ───────────────────────────────────────────────
tests/
test_*.py
*_test.py
junit.xml

# ── Development tooling ────────────────────────────────────────────
.venv
venv
.tox
requirements-dev.txt
requirements-airflow.txt
requirements-dbt.txt
requirements*.txt
!requirements.txt

# ── Documentation ───────────────────────────────────────────────
docs/
*.md
!README.md
LICENSE
CONTRIBUTING*
CHANGELOG*
SECURITY.md

# ── CI/CD configs (not needed at runtime) ───────────────────────────
ci_cd/
.pre-commit-config.yaml
pyproject.toml
setup.cfg
Makefile
tox.ini

# ── macOS / IDE artifacts ─────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
.idea
.vscode
*.swp
*.swo

# ── Local database files (never bake into image) ─────────────────────
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3

# ── Build output ────────────────────────────────────────────────
dist/
build/
*.egg-info
